  "details": "Please permanently add the native 3rd person camera controls that were in the 3P beta.\n\nBeing able to cycle camera views and use the Tab key to rotate and Scroll wheel to zoom was a massive quality-of-life improvement for desktop users. It made navigating worlds and viewing our own avatars significantly easier and more immersive.\n\nNow we have to rely on clunky 3rd-party prefabs to achieve this, which is difficult for average users to set up. The beta version was seamless and near perfect. Please bring it to the live build as a standard toggle!\n\n(Attached below is a clip of how well it worked during the 3P beta :(",
